{"ref":"BDB, סַנְחֵרִיב","hw":"סַנְחֵרִיב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">סַנְחֵרִיב</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. Sennacherib (</strong>= <em>Sinaḫê-irba</em>, <em>Sin multiplied brothers</em>, Schr<sup>COT</sup> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.13\">2 K 18:13</a><strong>)</strong>;—son of Sargon and father of Esarhaddon, king of Assyria (b. c. 705–681; cf. Tiele<sup>Gesch. 285 ff.</sup>); <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.13\">2 K 18:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.16\">19:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:36\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.36\">36</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.1\">Is 36:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.17\">37:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:37\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.37\">37</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.1\">2 Ch 32:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.22\">22</a> (all as above, except <span dir=\"rtl\">סַנְחֵרִב</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.20\">2 K 19:20</a>); 𝔊 Σενναχηρειμ, 𝔊L Σενναχειρειμ; Σεναχήριβος Jos<sup>Ant. x. 1 ff.</sup>; Σαναχάρβον (acc.) Herodot.<sup>ii. 141</sup>.","next":"BDB, סַנָּה","prev":"BDB, סַנְוֵרִים"}